    ["A strange era, a bizarre suicide. But perhaps because a bullet passed through my brain, there are some things I can't remember at all."] = "Странная эпоха, странное самоубийство. Но, возможно, из-за того, что пуля прошла через мой мозг, некоторые вещи я вообще не могу вспомнить.",
    ["一便士……两便士……"] = "Одна копейка... две копейки...",
    ["A mysterious drink called 'Caramel Bomb' leads you to the most urgent intestinal crisis of your life. You rush into the restroom, only to find two devout students chanting a holy name toward the toilet. It turns out you are not the only victim of this 'sacred poison'. You and the drink's inventor, Shermin, try to optimize this sinful sweet water. After several attempts, the formula becomes increasingly mysterious, and a desperate Shermin pours the residue into the toilet—the toilet becomes as clean as new! A week later, every Tingen citizen has a bottle of lemon-scented cleaning agent, while the students who light candles and pray in the restroom are still hoping for the return of the 'Caramel Bomb'."] = "A mysterious drink called 'Caramel Bomb' leads you to the most urgent intestinal crisis of your life. You rush into the restroom, only to find two devout students chanting a holy name toward the toilet. It turns out you are not the only victim of this 'sacred poison'. You and the drink's inventor, Shermin, try to optimize this sinful sweet water. After several attempts, the formula becomes increasingly mysterious, and a desperate Shermin pours the residue into the toilet—the toilet becomes as clean as new! A week later, every Тинген citizen has a bottle of lemon-scented cleaning agent, while the students who light candles and pray in the restroom are still hoping for the return of the 'Caramel Bomb'.",
